    "title": "What happened to Psyonic Bionic Hand after appearing on Shark Tank season 15? Details explored - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Rakshanda Noor Khan ,\n1 hours ago Shark Tank featured a biomedical startup, Psyonic, which was founded in 2015 by Dr. Aadeel Akhtar, focused on building advanced, affordable prosthetics. Its flagship product, the Ability Hand, is a lightweight, durable bionic hand that gives users touch feedback through fingertip sensors that vibrate, making it the \"fastest bionic hand on the market.\" Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
